WEBVTT

00:43:59.496 --> 00:44:02.079
And we need you to sign this document
that says if things don't go

00:44:02.079 --> 00:44:06.204
the way we think and we can't make you
money like you just cheerfully walk away

00:44:06.204 --> 00:44:07.829
from it and we do the right
thing for humanity.

00:44:08.246 --> 00:44:10.746
And they were like, yes, we are
enthusiastic about that.

00:44:10.746 --> 00:44:12.454
We get that the mission comes first here.

00:44:12.871 --> 00:44:15.996
So again, I hope a phenomenal
investment for them.

00:44:16.204 --> 00:44:19.079
But they were like they really
pleasantly surprised us on

00:44:19.079 --> 00:44:20.788
the upside of how aligned
they were with us,

00:44:20.788 --> 00:44:25.413
about how strange the world may get here
and the need for us to have flexibility

00:44:25.413 --> 00:44:28.288
and put our mission first, even if that
means they lose all their money,

00:44:28.496 --> 00:44:30.621
which I hope they don't and
don't think they will.